# PHI: raw capture output. bp_capture.py fsyncs real measurements here by
# design, btmon writes .snoop, T-B1 writes night*.log. None belongs in git.
*.snoop
*-capture.jsonl
bp-capture.jsonl
bpcap*.log
night*.log

# The personal denylist the pre-push PHI gate reads. Never committed — the
# repo must not contain the strings the guard exists to keep out.
.githooks/pii-denylist.local.txt

# python tooling
.venv/
uv.lock
.pytest_cache/

# SwiftPM build products are local and contain absolute developer paths.
clients/apple/Packages/*/.build/

# Runtime data for the pi-panel live stopgap. Written on the Pi; local copies
# are only ever test fixtures and must not dirty the deploy-key checkout.
docs/design/pi-panel/direction-a-clinical/status.json
docs/design/pi-panel/direction-a-clinical/vitals_status.json
docs/design/pi-panel/direction-a-clinical/vitals_h10_history.json

# The app-comparison research package is local-only. It holds third-party
# quotation and unpublished analysis, and the owner's instruction is that it is
# never committed to this repository and never pushed to GitHub. It lives in its
# own repository, which has no remote (see docs/app_comparison/LOCAL-ONLY.md).
# This entry stops an ordinary `git add`; .githooks/pre-push gate 3c stops the
# push, because .gitignore alone is not a guarantee.
docs/app_comparison/
